<title>USA: Wrenhall ISD 100, Minn., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Wrenhall ISD 100, Minn., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $4.500 million of Wrenhall ISD 100, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.68 percent.</p>
</text>
